Barcelona captain Ronald Araujo is due to fly to Liverpool on Sunday to complete a move to the Premier League club.

The 27-year-old Uruguay international centre-back is expected to join on a season-long loan deal that also includes Liverpool having a €55million option to buy him.

@adjones_journo, @greggevans40 and @Laia_Cervello analyse why the deal makes sense for both Liverpool and Barcelona ⤵️
